  <!-- EN: questDescription(installation==DMSAC_Graveyard)-&gt;Intercepted corps traffic points to an automatroid graveyard held by [siteFactionName]. Decommissioned machines are piled across the field, and scavengers have been stripping them for parts, so the corps posted a guard: (*Threat)[enemiesCount] [enemiesLabel](/Threat).\n\nSome of the hulks may still be recoverable, and the guard post keeps its supplies on site.\n\nThe position fix expires in [siteTimeout].\n\nCaution: entering the graveyard counts as an attack on the corps. Once you arrive, its monitoring network will call in reinforcements after a countdown. -->
